,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\nType: <b>Bug</b>\n\nCurrently, the GitHub Copilot Agent is limited to reading only the first 101 lines of a file. This restriction is problematic for workflows involving large files, as it prevents the agent from accessing critical information located beyond this limit.\n\nExtension version: 0.27.2025042201\nVS Code version: Code - Insiders 1.100.0-insider (ef9b85d17a8cb56ce84b2b36f352598454861620, 2025-04-21T05:37:46.564Z)\nOS version: Windows_NT x64 10.0.26100\nModes:\n\n<details>\n<summary>System Info</summary>\n\n|Item|Value|\n|---|---|\n|CPUs|Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10210U CPU @ 1.60GHz (8 x 2112)|\n|GPU Status|2d_canvas: enabled<br>canvas_oop_rasterization: enabled_on<br>direct_rendering_display_compositor: disabled_off_ok<br>gpu_compositing: enabled<br>multiple_raster_threads: enabled_on<br>opengl: enabled_on<br>rasterization: enabled<br>raw_draw: disabled_off_ok<br>skia_graphite: disabled_off<br>video_decode: enabled<br>video_encode: enabled<br>vulkan: disabled_off<br>webgl: enabled<br>webgl2: enabled<br>webgpu: enabled<br>webnn: disabled_off|\n|Load (avg)|undefined|\n|Memory (System)|7.80GB (0.79GB free)|\n|Process Argv|--crash-reporter-id 351e808b-f4e1-4646-8fee-bfd066d759a2|\n|Screen Reader|no|\n|VM|0%|\n</details>\n<!-- generated by issue reporter -->","closed_by":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2856239698","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637#issuecomment-2856239698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637","id":2856239698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6qPsJS","user":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-05-06T22:12:06Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T22:12:06Z","body":"That isn't true. It can read whatever it wants","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2856239698/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2985829718","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637#issuecomment-2985829718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637","id":2985829718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6x-CVW","user":{"login":"rcdailey","id":1768054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjgwNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1768054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey","html_url":"https://github.com/rcdailey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcdailey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T22:08:18Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T22:08:18Z","body":"@roblourens what an incredibly unconstructive response. What it *can* do and what it *does* do might be two completely different things. Engaging in constructive discussion, where you ask follow up questions, might help identify those differences.\n\nI can say that I have observed the behavior OP is reporting. A 500 line file requires 4 or so read operations to completely get into copilot context, which is incredibly slow (especially with Anthropic models) and hurts productivity with copilot agent mode:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59ee808e-8abf-44c0-88f0-31e11005a3bd)\n\nI hope that the maintainers will consider reopening this issue or at least linking to a duplicate with a higher level of detail (if available).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2985829718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2994389567","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637#issuecomment-2994389567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637","id":2994389567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6yesI_","user":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-06-22T19:20:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T19:20:53Z","body":"Sorry for coming across a bit short. I agree that this is very annoying, especially since Claude requests are a bit slower. We've tried multiple prompt changes to get it to read more efficiently, but this seems to be trained model behavior across multiple models. I've seen it reading in small chunks, reading overlapping ranges, re-reading the same chunk before editing, etc.\n\nWe still have some ongoing experiments here too, including more prompt changes or alternate tools to read more efficiently. In your case, clearly it needs to just read the whole plan before it can execute on it, and I just really can't explain why the model doesn't get that. It knows how large the file is after the first read.\n\nIf you didn't attach the plan.md as an explicit reference to your chat request, that might help. But a larger attachment may have also been summarized. In other cases, we don't want to waste the context window by reading too much.\n\nI don't think there is an open OSS issue for this so I'll reopen.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2994389567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3647968395","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637#issuecomment-3647968395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/8637","id":3647968395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7Zb5SL","user":{"login":"roblourens","id":323878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzg3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens","html_url":"https://github.com/roblourens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roblourens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-12-12T20:05:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:05:12Z","body":"We've made a bunch of changes to how the read_file and searching tools work. It's still a hard problem but between that, and more modern models, I think this is doing much better these days.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3647968395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}